299	52	27	processed\\pages\\1782740166555-FinalAiReportTP1 (1)-27.png	C- Final W1: [[-0.11813795 0.44359383 -0.58900064] [-0.64554125 0.08233114 -0.06582608]] Final Error (Er): [[2.9802322e-08] [0.0000000e+00]] Final dW1 (Weight Change): [[-1.0955168e-08 0.0000000e+00 -1.0955168e-08] [-1.6295946e-08 0.0000000e+00 -1.6295946e-08]] D- We will simply pass back the patterns to the trained model and confirm that the output is the same as the target: # Test the trained model on all input patterns (stimuli) with torch.no_grad(): # Disable gradient computation outputs = model(P.T) # Forward pass print ("Output for each stimulus input:") print (outputs.numpy()) # Convert to NumPy and display # If using a threshold for classification (like hardlim in MATLAB) classified_outputs = (outputs >= 0.5).float() # Threshold at 0.5 print ("\\nClassified Output (Thresholded at 0.5):") print (classified_outputs.numpy()) # Convert to NumPy and display Final W1:	processed\\qrcodes\\1782740166555-FinalAiReportTP1 (1).pdf-page-27-qr.png	f	native-pdf	\N	\N	2026-06-29 06:37:04.928144	7cd332d818beeaf08cb584f047dc213a527ca85327119618bc7803a460a9b5bf	{"v": 1, "type": "page", "checksum": "demo-checksum", "documentId": "1782740166555-FinalAiReportTP1 (1).pdf", "pageNumber": 27}
