329	78	5	processed\\pages\\1785941279244-GraphQL-5.png	Step 4: Create a Model Class (Book.java) Create a new package com.example.graphql.model, and inside it, create Book.java: package com.example.graphql.model; import lombok.AllArgsConstructor; import lombok.Data; import lombok.NoArgsConstructor; @Data @AllArgsConstructor @NoArgsConstructor public class Book { private String id; private String title; private String author; private int pages; } Step 5: Create a Repository (BookRepository.java) Create a new package com.example.graphql.repository, and inside it, create BookRepository.java: package com.example.graphql.repository; import com.example.graphql.model.Book; import org.springframework.stereotype.Repository; import java.util.ArrayList; import java.util.List;	processed\\qrcodes\\1785941279244-GraphQL.docx-page-5-qr.png	f	native-pdf	\N	\N	2026-08-05 07:48:28.312207	b13f4d1d00bbae7257cb609da10a15adf46d9f3f3e6a9711a3492dcf44eb9699	{"v": 1, "type": "page", "checksum": "demo-checksum", "documentId": "1785941279244-GraphQL.docx", "pageNumber": 5}
